            text: `<p></p> <p>Consider the following relation:<br> \$\$ \\mathrm{Scores(Team, Day, Opponent, Runs)} \$\$<br>Given that: </p> <ul> <li>Each tuple represents the number of runs scored by Team against Opponent on a given Day.</li> <li>A team plays at most one match per day.</li> <li>The attribute Runs is an integer and never NULL.</li> <li>There are multiple matches on the same day.</li> </ul> <p>Query Q1</p> <pre data-pbcklang="sql" data-pbcktabsize="4" class="prettyprint linenums lang-sql prettyprinted" style=""><ol class="linenums"><li class="L0"><span class="pln">SELECT S1</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Team</span><span class="pun">,</span><span class="pln"> S1</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Day</span></li><li class="L1"><span class="pln">FROM </span><span class="typ">Scores</span><span class="pln"> S1</span></li><li class="L2"><span class="pln">WHERE S1</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Runs</span><span class="pln"> </span><span class="pun">&lt;=</span><span class="pln"> ALL </span><span class="pun">(</span></li><li class="L3"><span class="pln">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SELECT S2</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Runs</span></li><li class="L4"><span class="pln">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;FROM </span><span class="typ">Scores</span><span class="pln"> S2</span></li><li class="L5"><span class="pln">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;WHERE S2</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Day</span><span class="pln"> </span><span class="pun">=</span><span class="pln"> S1</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Day</span></li><li class="L6"><span class="pln">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class="pun">);</span></li></ol></pre> <p><br>Query Q2</p> <pre data-pbcklang="sql" data-pbcktabsize="4" class="prettyprint linenums lang-sql prettyprinted" style=""><ol class="linenums"><li class="L0"><span class="pln">SELECT S1</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Team</span><span class="pun">,</span><span class="pln"> S1</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Day</span></li><li class="L1"><span class="pln">FROM </span><span class="typ">Scores</span><span class="pln"> S1</span></li><li class="L2"><span class="pln">WHERE NOT EXISTS </span><span class="pun">(</span></li><li class="L3"><span class="pln">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SELECT </span><span class="pun">*</span></li><li class="L4"><span class="pln">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;FROM </span><span class="typ">Scores</span><span class="pln"> S2</span></li><li class="L5"><span class="pln">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;WHERE S2</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Day</span><span class="pln"> </span><span class="pun">=</span><span class="pln"> S1</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Day</span></li><li class="L6"><span class="pln">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;AND S2</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Runs</span><span class="pln"> </span><span class="pun">&lt;</span><span class="pln"> S1</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Runs</span></li><li class="L7"><span class="pln">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class="pun">);</span></li></ol></pre> <p><br>Query Q3</p> <pre data-pbcklang="sql" data-pbcktabsize="4" class="prettyprint linenums lang-sql prettyprinted" style=""><ol class="linenums"><li class="L0"><span class="pln">SELECT S1</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Team</span><span class="pun">,</span><span class="pln"> S1</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Day</span></li><li class="L1"><span class="pln">FROM </span><span class="typ">Scores</span><span class="pln"> S1</span></li><li class="L2"><span class="pln">WHERE S1</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Runs</span><span class="pln"> </span><span class="pun">=</span><span class="pln"> </span><span class="pun">(</span></li><li class="L3"><span class="pln">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SELECT MIN</span><span class="pun">(</span><span class="pln">S2</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Runs</span><span class="pun">)</span></li><li class="L4"><span class="pln">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;FROM </span><span class="typ">Scores</span><span class="pln"> S2</span></li><li class="L5"><span class="pln">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;WHERE S2</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Day</span><span class="pln"> </span><span class="pun">=</span><span class="pln"> S1</span><span class="pun">.</span><span class="typ">Day</span></li><li class="L6"><span class="pln">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class="pun">);</span></li></ol></pre> <p><br>Which of the following statements are CORRECT?</p> <p></p>`,
